            "header": "@@ -1,0 +1,26 @@",
            "lines": [
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 1,
                "text": "---"
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 2,
                "text": "name: liquibase-migration-review"
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 3,
                "text": "description: Review Liquibase changelogs for safe, reversible database migrations. Use when a change adds or edits files under db/changelog, or when asked to review a schema migration."
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 4,
                "text": "license: Apache-2.0"
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 5,
                "text": "metadata:"
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 6,
                "text": "  maintainer: platform-guild"
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 7,
                "text": "---"
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 8,
                "text": ""
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 9,
                "text": "# Liquibase migration review"
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 10,
                "text": ""
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 11,
                "text": "Use this skill when a change touches Liquibase changelogs (`db/changelog/**`)."
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 12,
                "text": ""
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 13,
                "text": "## Procedure"
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 14,
                "text": ""
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 15,
                "text": "1. Find the master changelog and confirm every new changeset is included from it."
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 16,
                "text": "2. For each new changeset, check the items in [the checklist](references/checklist.md)."
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 17,
                "text": "3. Never edit a changeset that may already be applied. Add a new one instead."
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 18,
                "text": "4. Confirm each changeset has a `rollback` or is explicitly marked irreversible"
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 19,
                "text": "   with a reason in its `comment`."
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 20,
                "text": "5. Flag locking risks: adding `NOT NULL` columns without defaults, building"
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 21,
                "text": "   indexes on large tables without `CONCURRENTLY` (PostgreSQL), renames."
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 22,
                "text": "6. Summarize findings as: blocking issues, risks, suggestions."
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 23,
                "text": ""
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 24,
                "text": "## Output"
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 25,
                "text": ""
              },
              {
                "tag": "added",
                "oldLine": null,
                "newLine": 26,
                "text": "A short review with file and changeset ids for every finding."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "added": 26,
        "removed": 0,
        "binary": false,
        "truncated": false
      },
      "executable": false
